@startuml 04_processo_get_forwarding
title Vista de Processo - GET com forwarding P2P (US107/US113)
actor "ATCC" as C
participant "Instância A :8081" as A
participant "Instância B :8082" as B
participant "Instância C :8083" as Cc

C -> A : GET /api/airports/CDG\nAuthorization: Bearer JWT
activate A
A -> A : JwtAuthenticationFilter + RBAC
A -> A : procura local (H2)
alt existe localmente
  A --> C : 200 AirportViewDTO + links HATEOAS
else não existe localmente
  A -> B : GET /api/airports/CDG\nX-P2P-Hops: 1\n(timeout ligação 2s, leitura 3s)
  alt B responde 404
    B --> A : 404 Not Found
    A -> Cc : GET /api/airports/CDG\nX-P2P-Hops: 1
    Cc --> A : 200 AirportViewDTO
    A --> C : 200 AirportViewDTO + links HATEOAS
  else B inacessível (timeout / ligação recusada)
    A -> A : try/catch: ignora a falha de B
    A -> Cc : GET /api/airports/CDG\nX-P2P-Hops: 1
    Cc --> A : 200 AirportViewDTO
    A --> C : 200 AirportViewDTO + links HATEOAS
  end
end
note over A, Cc
  X-P2P-Hops limita os saltos e evita forwarding circular.
  Se nenhum peer tiver o dado: 404 ao cliente.
end note
deactivate A
@enduml
